Project: Bit Flip Manipulation
Operations: flipbits (bitwise NOT via -1-x), popcount (32-bit)
Tests:
  For each value in [5,3,8,1,9,2,7,4]:
    popcount(x) + popcount(flip(x)) must equal 32 (all bits accounted for)
  flipbits(0) == -1   (0x00000000 -> 0xFFFFFFFF)
  flipbits(-1) == 0   (0xFFFFFFFF -> 0x00000000)
Expected exit code: 0
